    "description": "Slots Era is a brand new horizon in the world of Vegas Slot Machines. Try one of the best casino games for FREE. Start your epic adventure in a new world with exclusive and thrilling slot machines.\r\n\r\nPass your missions with unified progress for all slots. Dice roll bonus games for our top players! Collect card collections for huge rewards. Receive jewels to get the puzzle pieces and claim epic heroes!\r\n\r\nPlay Slots Era and enjoy our fantastic features:\r\n\u2022 12 million welcome bonus for a rich start to play the best free Vegas slot machines for new players.\r\n\r\n\u2022 220+ 777 HD slot machines: Spin over 200+ slots and enjoy the endless quest with huge jackpots and bonus games. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Monthly events: Recurring monthly events to earn extra rewards, bonuses, free spins to keep you entertained.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Play Slots Era online and offline. You can enjoy the game wherever you are. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Free Mode feature.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Regular updates: New slots drop every week. An endless slot journey with epic quests.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Connect to your social media accounts.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get free coins in our hourly bonus game.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Highest stakes for the best of players in the Jackpot Room.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Unlock jackpots, free spins, and bonus games by spinning Las Vegas casino slot machines. Spin and win coins from the real Vegas casino slots!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Stunning graphics and soundtracks. Sounds from the heart of Vegas to your ears.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Massive coin packages, huge jackpots and extra benefits. Endless ways to collect BIG casino bonuses.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Our Status System rewards long-time players with bigger bonuses. The longer you play - the bigger the bonus coins.\r\n\r\nYou will meet many famous characters straight from the worlds of history, culture, and nature. We\u2019ll give you a glimpse of only a few of our amazing slots here:\t\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Magic of Oz. An amazing slot machine with lots of free spins, big wins, and wild monkeys ;)\t\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Lord of Olympus. Win the favor of Zeus and the bonus spins are all yours.\t\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Cleopatra and Caesar. Discover an incredible vegas casino slot game and be like a Great Pharaoh - the Lord of the Egyptian lands.\t\r\n\r\n\u2b50Mighty Dragon. Mega Spins, Grand Jackpot, and a lot of Wild & Scatter symbols. But such places have a powerful guardian.\t\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Leprechaun's Luck. Fill the pots with gold and get magic wins. Try your luck with this free slot machine.\r\n\r\nDo you like your Vegas casino slots free? Then Slots Era is an epic adventure you don't want to miss. The stakes have never been higher in free slots games! Download and play for FREE!\r\n\t\r\nWe have also made two other popular casino slots games that you might find interesting! Scatter Slots is an engaging slot journey through the realms of fantasy. Infinity Slots is a great game where you can get a taste of Las Vegas luxury casino.\r\n\t\r\nHave fun playing our casino games and best of luck to you!\r\n\t\r\nFROM THE CREATORS OF SLOTS ERA:\r\n\t\r\nThis game is intended for an adult audience and does not offer \"real money gambling\". Practice or success at social gaming does not imply future success at \"real money gambling\". Use of this application is governed by Murka's Terms of Service. Collection and use of personal data are subject to Murka's Privacy Policy.\r\n\t\r\nBy downloading this application, you are accepting Terms of Service & updated Privacy Policy:\r\n\t\r\nhttp://murka.com/#terms-of-service\r\n\t\r\nhttp://murka.com/#privacy-policy",
